# Gabriel Session Plugins Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/session-plugins/FEATURE.md` and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` before changing this area.
- Update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/session-plugins/FEATURE.md` in the same turn whenever behavior, file ownership, load paths, settings, or dependencies change.
- When `GabrielSessionPlugins.cslist` sources change in ways users discover from the
  tree overview, update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`.
- If the change crosses into another Gabriel area, update both adjacent docs.
